  "interpretation": [
    "Layer-targeted weighting did not reliably beat the uniform penalty on mapped core toggles at acceptable accuracy.",
    "Penalizing only the last layer reduced layer-4 logical changes by only about 0.7-1.5% even with 4x per-gate weight; the mechanism is not established (layer-4 gates did not become constant; a class-vote limit is not supported).",
    "Do not describe targeting as slightly better: the mean gap mixes ineligible models, comes mostly from seed 3 and has higher accuracy cost (RAMP 1.48 pp vs U0.2 0.62 pp mean drop).",
    "Mapped/logical reduction ratio is about 0.2 for U, RAMP, M23 and L34; for L4 the logical reduction is tiny and synthesis variation dominates.",
